OL,3,GNEWSAControversial Orange Order march
OL,4,Ato go ahead for first time since 1997
OL,5,Aafter day of legal drama
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe march is due to begin at 08:00 BST
OL,8,Fand last no longer than 90 minutes
OL,10,FIt will travel from Portadown town
OL,11,Fcentre out to Drumcree church, before
OL,12,Freturning via the Garvaghy Road
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
